{"id": "e9bf09abaca885421c3d654398f0eb2708088cf9", "candidate_id": "rhodes_conway", "candidate_name": "Satya Rhodes-Conway", "collector": "google_news", "title": "Can Wisconsin Democrats end cycle of city referendums, budget cuts? - Wisconsin State Journal", "text": "With Democrats taking full control of state government for the first time in 16 years, Dane County mayors are looking to the new majority for relief from rising costs and a seemingly endless cycle of unpopular budget cuts and property tax referendums. Janairo Diaz Arata-Fratta Swadley Steve Stocker Stay up-to-date on the latest in local and national government and political topics with our newsletter. Growth and Development Reporter {{description}} Email notifications are only sent once a day, and only if there are new matching items. {{description}} Email notifications are only sent once a day, and only if there are new matching items.", "source": "Wisconsin State Journal", "source_url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiogFBVV95cUxOSXVoWE5FUV9XT05uUHFqZ2w1dVJUSDcxSTNfOTFNLUsyRE9EVi1tUVEtbm0zckE0UWYxZzhTeVl2cDlCczRzSjlGYnVLN3czOHAxa1JzM0FNcktXbTQ3cDhYUGRFMDdkdnN6UWE1enFZRTh3dGU0ZTM0RVkyUnY2bnR5Q082RDBxVTJ2WXozVkJjVVFyQTU2bHpoeDMzNWN1TkE?oc=5", "resolved_url": "https://madison.com/news/local/government-politics/article_0bb2ea55-5155-4c5f-a01f-782d8c6c8f69.html", "url_resolution": "gnews_decode", "text_source": "full_text", "full_text_status": "ok", "published_at": "2026-11-06T12:50:00+00:00", "reason": "no_name_match"}
